"The tests of lambda. Each test: DEF answers T or F, most of them over the composed store; test:report names each verdict and test:all is their conjunction. This file is a tuple literal of the same form and vocabulary as arest and is read the same way by every host. Only the test compositions read it (build.js cli, test and regress); a served module composes arest alone.",

