"test:ot_federation holds the derivation to the composed store with User backed by law-sys at /api/users, identified at email|lower, law-sys speaking payload, and User is human federated at human and User has Email at email|lower. The User is its own reader of $.docs; a row reads User is human of its key only when human is true; UserIsHuman:set is a PATCH whose query names the document by where[email][equals] and whose body sets human true; a write that asserts User is human of a@x performs UserIsHuman:set of a@x, and a sync that asserts it performs nothing.",
