    S3(A("COMP"), S4(A("COND"), S3(A("COMP"), A("and"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("length"), N(1)), S3(A("COMP"), A("length"), N(2)))), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), K(N(0)), S3(A("COMP"), S5(A("COMP"), A("length"), A("theta:flatten"), S2(A("ALPHA"), S4(A("COND"), S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), N(2))), K(PHI()), S2(A("CONS"), N(1)))), A("distr")), A("id")))))), K(A("T")), K(A("F"))), S3(A("CONS"), A("rmap:tables"), A("rmap:ntnames")))),

