"AND A NAVIGATION ANSWERS ONLY THE PANES IT CHANGED. A platform that holds the root in its master pane and asks for the entity Function Function gets the detail pane alone: the entity goes to the detail pane, and the master pane, whose stack the navigation left as it was, is the one the platform already drew. It failed first, answering both panes, before ui:frame_panes asked which stacks had moved.",
