          K(S2(S2(A("PersonDiedUnexplained:1=Julia Stoner"), A("PersonDiedUnexplained")), S2(A("FixtureConnectsRoomToRoom:1=the ventilator|2=her bedroom|3=the study"), A("FixtureConnectsRoomToRoom")))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:seteq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("FactFillsRole")), A("test:fr_facts"))),
