"A FACT TYPE IN ANOTHER TABLE WHERE A COMPOUND-KEYED ENTITY PLAYS A ROLE ROUND-TRIPS AS ITS REFERENCE. Halpin ch. 10 maps a role played by an entity with a compound reference scheme to one foreign key column per component, and the inverse read each of those columns as a fact of the fact type it enters through, so on support a fact like Invoice Line Item belongs to Provider Resource would read back as two facts, one per component, and a relation over the entity as its first component alone. test:crr_files is test:cr_files`s Crate beside Item, identified by its Code, where each Item is packed in at most one Crate, and Crate is inspected on Date, many to many: written through the storage interface, read back as a boot reads it and the database cleared, as test:compound_roundtrip does, every fact type`s population reads back equal to what was written and the adopted store holds no alethic violation. Before the referencing columns read back as the reference, ItemIsPackedInCrate read back as i1, S1 and i1, A, CrateIsInspectedOnDate as S1, d1 twice and S1, d2, and this answered F.",
