"THE MIGRATION FIXTURE: Cost Tier identified by its Cost Source and Tier Name, two words each as on support, with at most one Rate, and Line Item identified by its Code, billing at most one Cost Tier; the readings state three Cost Tiers, A/x, A/y and B/x, with their components, A/x a Rate, and Line Item l1 billing A/x. test:cm_new is the store compile:check makes of it, laid out by the map as it is now; test:cm_old is a store laid out by the map as it was before a compound-keyed table kept its reference, its stored rmap:ctab cell rmap:ctab:base.",
DEF("test:cm_files",
