"A PASS FROM THE STORE THE LAST PASS WAS OVER IS A WHOLE PASS. After a pass over a store, every arm`s cell answers that store: the arms it computed were put, and the others answered it what they had answered their cells. So a store a pass added cells to is reflected from the store the pass was over, and only the arms whose reads the pass moved are computed again; the host repeats it until a pass adds nothing (loadReflected). Over test:rf_s0 and the two writes to it whose pass adds cells -- the Domain Change instance with its event, and a reflected cell dropped -- that pass adds what a whole pass adds over the store the first pass made.",
