"AND THE INCREMENTAL DOMAIN REFRESH IS THE WHOLE ONE. Over the composed store, each registration -- a new instance of a type with a domain, another of a second type, an instance its type already holds, an instance of a meta-type, an id that is a fact type`s name, one that is a role`s, one that is a domain`s name, an instance registered under a second type, a new value and a value another value type holds -- leaves through main:refresh_domain_of the domain rows main:refresh_domains leaves, as a set; and so do two in a row, the same new id twice and two new ids of two types. AND A VALUE GAINS NO ROW: the instances are CIDR Blocks and Streams, entity types of security.md, where until a value had no domain they were values of Abstract SQL Type and Block Kind; test:fbd_val_none holds that a value registered under Abstract SQL Type gains no row from either refresh, and failed before reflect:fbd_unowned.",
DEF("test:fbd_registered",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S5(A("CONS"), S5(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S2(A("ALPHA"), A("test:fbd_reg_one")), A("distl"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S(S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("law-fbd-new-1")), S2(A("Stream"), A("law-fbd-new-2")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("127.0.0.0/8")), S2(A("Object Type"), A("law-fbd-meta")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("ObjectTypeIsOfObjectKind")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("ObjectTypeIsOfObjectKind.1")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("core")), S2(A("Stream"), A("127.0.0.0/8")), S2(A("Abstract SQL Type"), A("law-fbd-val")), S2(A("Block Kind"), A("BIGINT")))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:fbd_reg_two"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("law-fbd-new-3")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("law-fbd-new-3")))))), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:fbd_reg_two"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(S2(A("Stream"), A("law-fbd-new-4")), S2(A("CIDR Block"), A("law-fbd-new-5")))))), A("test:fbd_val_none")))),
"<store>: the composed store with one Domain Change more, dc-law-step, which no row places, so its machine stands at its initial status, Proposed.",
DEF("test:sp_s0",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cls_put"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S1(S2(A("dc-law-step"), A("Domain Change"))))))),
