"A small store for test:plus_hides. PhHas is marked + and keyed by its Thing, asserted of t1 as keep; its rule copies PhSource, which holds t1 drop and t2 fresh. PhDropped and PhFresh are the Things whose PhHas reads drop and fresh.",
