       K(A("T"))))),
"<catch-up fixture>: the same with an alethic limit on where a gauge stands, as a value constraint would put it: LawAllowed, a Level a gauge may stand at, holding 0 only, and the subset if some Gauge is at some Level then that Level is allowed, named LawAt. The fixture meets it, law-gauge being at 0, and a replay that moves law-gauge breaks it.",
DEF("test:cu_fxr",
