"<store> to <the fixture, the store after one unrelated write, the replay of law-e2 and law-e1, the replay of law-gauge, the replay of law-e2 and law-e1 over the limited fixture asked of the verb directly, the same fired through SYSTEM, the limited fixture>.",
DEF("test:cu_run",
    S3(A("COMP"), S8(A("CONS"), A("id"), A("test:cu_w1"),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_fire"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("law-e2"), A("law-e1"))))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_fire"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S1(A("law-gauge"))))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("replay"), S3(A("CONS"), K(S2(A("law-e2"), A("law-e1"))), A("test:cu_fxr"))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_fire"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:cu_fxr"), K(S2(A("law-e2"), A("law-e1"))))),
          A("test:cu_fxr")),
       A("test:cu_fx"))),
"<fixture, written, replay of the Events, replay of the gauge, limited replay asked directly, limited replay fired, limited fixture> to the verdicts of test:event_catchup.",
DEF("test:cu_checks",
    S(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_at"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), K(A("0")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_at"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), K(A("0")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("law-e1")), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_open"), N(2)))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("law-e2")), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_open"), N(2)))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(2), N(3)), K(A("T")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_at"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), K(A("-0.34")))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("law-e1")), S4(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_open"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("law-e2")), S4(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_open"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("null"), A("cmd:sc_row"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), A("test:cu_ss"))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), A("tl")), A("test:cu_new"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), N(1))), K(S2(S2(A("law-nudge"), A("sm.law-gauge")), S2(A("law-nudge"), A("sm.law-gauge")))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:seteq"), S3(A("CONS"),
          S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), A("store:cu_strip")), A("distr"), S3(A("CONS"),
             S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_new"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), N(1))),
             S3(A("COMP"), A("system:pop_rows"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("EventOccurredAtTimestamp")), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))))))),
          K(S2(A("LawNudges:1=law-e1|2=law-gauge"), A("LawNudges:1=law-e2|2=law-gauge"))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("null"), A("theta:setminus"), S3(A("CONS"),
          S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), A("test:cu_new"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), N(1))),
          S4(A("COMP"), S2(A("ALPHA"), N(1)), A("test:cu_gained"), S4(A("CONS"), K(A("EventIsOfEventType")), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), N(1))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("solve:assoc"), S3(A("CONS"), K(A("sm.law-gauge")), S4(A("COMP"), A("main:sst_rows"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))))), K(A("law-drifting")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_at"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(4), N(1))), K(A("-0.34")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_at"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_rp"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), K(S2(A("law-e1"), A("law-e2"))))), K(A("-0.34")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("theta:seteq"), S3(A("CONS"),
          S4(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_causes"), A("test:cu_rp"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))), K(S2(A("law-e1"), A("law-e2"))))),
          S4(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_causes"), A("test:cu_out"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_refused"), N(5)),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(2), N(6)), K(A("F")))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_same"), S3(A("CONS"), N(5), N(7))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_same"), S3(A("CONS"), N(6), N(7))))),
"AN EVENT THAT REACHED A MACHINE BEFORE IT COULD FIRE IS REPLAYED BY HAND, IN ITS TIME`S ORDER, AND BY NOTHING ELSE, AS A WRITE STEPS IT AND THROUGH A WRITE`S GATE (such Events are not replayed automatically, they are a manual fire). Over test:cu_fx, law-e1 (LawPing, by 0.2, at 19:52:01) and law-e2 (LawPing2, by -0.5, at 20:09:06) reach law-gauge, whose machine Law Drift fires law-nudge on LawNudges, and no Event caused that transition for them; law-e3 reaches it too, and a cause in the form a write records names it. The fixture holds the subset instances.md declares (test:cu_ss): the Event a cause names is of the Event Type that triggers its Transition. A write that asserts nothing about any gauge replays nothing, as for any Event that fits nothing: law-gauge stays at 0 and law-e1 and law-e2 stay reached and unconsumed. The verb replay, fired through SYSTEM (main:as) by the system login with law-e2 and law-e1, named out of time order, answers that it held and steps law-e1 then law-e2: law-gauge, at 0 before, is at -0.34, which is 0.2 and then 0.8 x 0.2 - 0.5 (the other order reads -0.2, and law-e3 replayed would read otherwise again); law-e1 and law-e2 are consumed; the causes it wrote meet the subset; they are two, each of law-nudge in sm.law-gauge, each naming an Event the replay recorded, whose id less its time is the trigger fact spelled, LawNudges:1=law-e1|2=law-gauge and LawNudges:1=law-e2|2=law-gauge, as a write records a cause; and the machine stands at law-drifting. Fired with the instance law-gauge it answers the same, law-e3 being consumed already; and fired again with the two Events over the store it answered it steps nothing, law-gauge staying at -0.34 and no cause added. Over test:cu_fxr, where law-gauge may stand at 0 only, the same replay breaks that alethic limit: asked of the verb directly it answers 409 with a body, fired through SYSTEM it answers that it did not hold, and the store either answers is the store it was given, law-gauge at 0 and no cause or Event added. A replay that names the original Event as the cause, writes it ungated and mints no Event fails it: its causes break the subset, are not of the form above and name no Event the replay recorded, and the limited replay commits.",
DEF("test:event_catchup",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S3(A("COMP"), A("test:cu_checks"), A("test:cu_run")))),
"<store> to <the gauge schema, the post of an Event reaching law-gauge, the replace of it, and the two requests main:api0w routes, POST and PUT, of the same row>.",
