    S3(A("COMP"), S6(A("CONS"), A("id"),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("main:post_answer"), S4(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("LawNudges")), K(S2(A("law-e9"), A("law-gauge"))))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("main:replace_step"), S4(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("LawNudges")), K(S2(A("law-e9"), A("law-gauge"))))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("main:api0w"), S6(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("POST")), K(A("LawNudges")), K(A("")), K(S2(A("law-e9"), A("law-gauge"))))),
          S3(A("COMP"), A("main:api0w"), S6(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(A("PUT")), K(A("LawNudges")), K(A("")), K(S2(A("law-e9"), A("law-gauge")))))),
       A("test:dft_schema"))),
"<answer> to T when it is a refusal with a reason: status 409, and a body that is not empty.",
DEF("test:dw_refused",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("and"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), K(N(409)))), S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("theta:member"), S3(A("CONS"), N(1), K(S2(A(""), A("[]")))))))),
"<answer, store> to T when the answer leaves the store as it was: it carries no store, which a host adopts nothing of, or the store itself.",
DEF("test:dw_same",
    S4(A("COND"), S3(A("COMP"), A("lt"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), A("length"), N(1)), K(N(3)))), K(A("T")), S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(3), N(1)), N(2))))),
"<schema, post, replace, api POST, api PUT> to the verdicts of test:derived_write.",
DEF("test:dw_checks",
    S7(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_refused"), N(2)),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_same"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), N(1))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_refused"), N(3)),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_same"), S3(A("CONS"), N(3), N(1))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_refused"), N(4)),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_refused"), N(5)))),
"A FACT OF A DERIVED HEAD IS NOT POSTED OR PUT, AND THE REFUSAL SAYS WHY (a `*` or `**` head takes GET and a DELETE that retracts its source facts, and no POST or PUT). A fact POST of a `**` head answered nothing through the MCP. Over test:dft_schema, whose LawNudges is derived and stored: main:post_answer of <law-e9, law-gauge> answers refused (409) with a reason and the store it was given; main:replace_step answers the same; and the requests main:api0w routes, a POST and a PUT of the row, answer refused with a reason, where a POST answered an empty body with unknown_resource (404), LawNudges not being declared, which a client shows as no output at all.",
