       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:rt_one"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:rt_fx0"), K(S1(S3(A("ThingHasColor"), A("mandatory"), A("t3")))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:rt_one"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:rt_fxa"), K(S1(A("Mandatory violation: Thing t3 does not participate in ThingHasColor"))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:rt_one"), S3(A("CONS"), A("test:rt_fxb"), K(S1(A("Mandatory violation: Thing t3 does not participate in Thing has Color")))))))),
"<store>: the composed store with two asserted fact types, LawDrdIn, a Function in a Description, and LawDrdSub, a Description under another, and two heads derived and stored from them: LawDrdHas, each Function in some Description, a projection of LawDrdIn; and LawDrdUnder, a Function under each Description a Description it is in is under, a join of LawDrdIn and LawDrdSub projected, as test:sdr_schema derives LawSdrProper.",
