"The asserted rows of the fixture, each <fact type, row>: law-drd-f1 in law-drd-d1, law-drd-f2 in law-drd-d2 and in law-drd-d3, law-drd-d1 under law-drd-e1, and law-drd-d2 and law-drd-d3 each under law-drd-e2.",
