    S3(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S3(A("COMP"), S8(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), K(N(201)))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("test:drd_holds"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdIn"), S2(A("law-drd-f1"), A("law-drd-d1")))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("test:drd_holds"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdSub"), S2(A("law-drd-d1"), A("law-drd-e1")))))),
       S4(A("COMP"), A("not"), A("test:drd_holds"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdUnder"), S2(A("law-drd-f1"), A("law-drd-e1")))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:drd_holds"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdUnder"), S2(A("law-drd-f2"), A("law-drd-e2")))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:drd_only"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdIn"), S2(S2(A("law-drd-f2"), A("law-drd-d2")), S2(A("law-drd-f2"), A("law-drd-d3"))))))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:drd_only"), S3(A("CONS"), A("id"), K(S2(A("LawDrdSub"), S2(S2(A("law-drd-d2"), A("law-drd-e2")), S2(A("law-drd-d3"), A("law-drd-e2")))))))),
       A("test:drd_rb")))),
"A RETRACT OF A ROW DERIVED ALONG TWO PATHS THAT SHARE NO FACT IS REFUSED, NAMING THE FACTS, AND NOTHING IS GUESSED. Over test:drd_fx, law-drd-f2 is under law-drd-e2 along two paths, through law-drd-d2 and through law-drd-d3, and no asserted fact is on both: a fact DELETE of that row of LawDrdUnder answers refused (409); the answer carries the store it was given; and its body is the refusal with the four candidate facts, each <fact type, row>, in the order of their JSON: law-drd-f2 in law-drd-d2 and in law-drd-d3, and law-drd-d2 and law-drd-d3 under law-drd-e2. Before main:dr_plan the retract committed and took the head row alone.",
DEF("test:derived_retract_ambiguous",
    S3(A("COMP"), A("fp:and_all"), S3(A("COMP"), S4(A("CONS"),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(2), N(2)), K(N(409)))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("test:dw_same"), S3(A("CONS"), N(2), N(1))),
       S3(A("COMP"), A("eq"), S3(A("CONS"), S3(A("COMP"), N(1), N(2)), S3(A("COMP"), A("render:json"), K(S3(A("refused"), A("retract refused: the row is derived along more than one path and no fact is on every one, so which facts to retract is not determined; retract one of these instead"), S4(
          S2(A("LawDrdIn"), S2(A("law-drd-f2"), A("law-drd-d2"))),
          S2(A("LawDrdIn"), S2(A("law-drd-f2"), A("law-drd-d3"))),
          S2(A("LawDrdSub"), S2(A("law-drd-d2"), A("law-drd-e2"))),
          S2(A("LawDrdSub"), S2(A("law-drd-d3"), A("law-drd-e2")))))))))),
       A("test:drd_rc")))),
"<store>: the composed store marking three heads, LawNvView derived on query (*), LawNvKept derived and stored (**) and LawNvEntered semi-derived (+); LawNvSaid is marked nothing, so it is asserted.",
