"AN ENTITY RETRACT NAMED FOR NO COLLECTION FINDS THE ONE HOLDING ITS ID (main:re_group): an id that is an instance of a collection resolves to it whatever type the row names, and an id that is nobody`s resolves to none, which the retract refuses as before.",
